OL,3,GNEWSASisters of 'Putney pusher' suspect
OL,4,Asay DNA will clear his name
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrandram was found dead in his west
OL,7,FLondon home on Tuesday. His family have
OL,8,Finsisted he was innocent and said he
OL,9,F"took his own life after months of
OL,10,Fimmense pressure" caused by the Met
OL,11,Finvestigation.
OL,13,FThe Met said it recognised the "strain
OL,14,Fthat being subject to a police
OL,15,Finvestigation" could cause, but did not
OL,16,Frespond to this specific claim.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
